  "notes": "USAGE:\nThe military sense (sense 1) is common in historical texts, war movies, and games. The figurative sense (sense 2) is widely used in media, especially for the format {突撃|とつげき}インタビュー (ambush interview) and {突撃|とつげき}レポート (surprise-visit report).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {突撃|とつげき}する: to charge, to rush in\n- {突撃|とつげき}インタビュー: ambush interview\n- {突撃|とつげき}レポート: surprise-visit report\n- {突撃|とつげき}{命令|めいれい}: order to charge",
